ovided, I need to follow the structure, using the numbers 94 and 66, and show the steps leading to 6204.\n\nThe user's initial answer was 6404, but the correct answer is 6204. So I need to present the correct reasoning here.\n\nAlright, proceeding to fill the template accordingly.\n</think>\n\n",
